---
---
<section class="section-shell about-section" id="about">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT SORA / <span class="about-face" aria-hidden="true">:3</span></span>
        <h2>Hi, I'm Sora.<br /><em>Nice to meet you~</em></h2>
        <p>Come in, get comfy, and peek at what I've been making. <span class="about-face" aria-hidden="true">(˶&gt;⩊&lt;˶)</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-layout">
        <article class="material-card about-intro">
            <div class="about-intro__image"><img src="/sora-profile.jpg" alt="Sora" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div>
            <div class="about-intro__content">
                <div class="card-kicker">01 / HELLO, YOU ///</div>
                <h3>Soft heart. Big ideas.</h3>
                <p>Hii~ I make AI besties, tiny worlds, and cute little corners of the web. If you think they're cool, shhh... you're making me blush <span class="about-face" aria-hidden="true">(⁄ ⁄&gt;⁄ω⁄&lt;⁄ ⁄)</span></p>
                <div class="about-intro__actions"><button class="text-button" id="easterEggTitle" type="button">A tiny secret <svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" /></svg></button><a class="button button--quiet" href="https://github.com/celestial-sora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" /></svg></a></div>
                <p class="about-secret" id="aboutSecret" hidden>Psst... I'm a femboy, okay? Be nice to me~ <span class="about-face" aria-hidden="true">(&gt;///&lt;)</span></p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <div class="about-stats">
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index" aria-hidden="true">&gt;~&lt;</span><strong>I make</strong><small>AI · web · stories</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index" aria-hidden="true">^^</span><strong>I adore</strong><small>Cute little details</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index" aria-hidden="true">&gt;///&lt;</span><strong>I share</strong><small>Code &amp; experiments</small></article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-face { white-space: nowrap; }
</style>

<script>
    const easterEgg = document.getElementById('easterEggTitle');
    const secret = document.getElementById('aboutSecret');
    easterEgg?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (secret) secret.hidden = !secret.hidden;
    });
</script>
